---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {pdkContent as c} from '../data/pdk-content';
import {pinnacleWave} from '../data/pinnacleai-wave';
import {phone,url} from '../data/site';
import hero from '../assets/pdk-connected-story-20261005.png';
import social from '../assets/pinnacleai-pdk-social-20260930.png';
import '../styles/pdk.css';
const page=pinnacleWave.find(p=>p.slug==='personal-development-kernel')!;
const canonical=url('/personal-development-kernel');
const graph=[{'@type':'DefinedTerm','@id':canonical+'#module',name:'Personal Development Kernel',alternateName:'PDK',url:canonical,description:c.direct,isPartOf:{'@id':url('/pinnacleai')+'#software'},subjectOf:c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))}];
---
<PageLayout path="/personal-development-kernel" label="Personal Development Kernel" title={page.title} description={page.description} shareImage={social} shareVersion="2026-09-30-pinnacleai-editorial" imageAlt="Personal Development Kernel · PinnacleAI branded social creative with 9100 181 181" includeService={false} primaryEntityId={canonical+'#module'} entityGraph={graph} citations={c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))} faqs={c.faqs} publishedOn="2026-09-30" updatedOn={c.updatedOn} breadcrumbParent={{name:'PinnacleAI®',path:'/pinnacleai'}}>
<div class="pdk-page">
  <section class="pdk-hero pdk-wrap" aria-labelledby="pdk-title">
    <div class="pdk-intro"><p class="pdk-kicker"><Icon name="plan" size={22}/>PinnacleAI® · Personal Development Kernel</p><h1 id="pdk-title">Your child’s story should <em>move forward.</em><br/>Not start over.</h1><p class="pdk-lead">{c.lead}</p><p class="pdk-purpose">{c.purpose}</p><div class="pdk-actions"><a class="pdk-btn pdk-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="pdk-btn" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Plan a first conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><p class="pdk-help">Telephone guidance is free. We’ll explain the suitable professional, centre, first visit and fees before you decide.</p><a class="pdk-text-link" href={url('/centers')}><Icon name="pin" size={20}/>Find a Pinnacle centre →</a></div>
    <figure class="pdk-hero-art"><Image src={hero} widths={[400,640,900,1254]} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 46vw, (min-width: 700px) 620px, 100vw" format="webp" quality={80} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustrative Pinnacle family and therapist reviewing shoes, with a PDK pathway from relevant observations to a child-specific record, authorised review, next support and observation again."/><figcaption>PDK’s record concept, shown through an illustrative family scene.</figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <nav class="pdk-jump pdk-wrap" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#what-it-does"><Icon name="plan" size={18}/>What PDK does</a><a href="#worked-example"><Icon name="home" size={18}/>Home and school example</a><a href="#architecture"><Icon name="loop" size={18}/>Inputs → record → review</a><a href="#sources"><Icon name="shield" size={18}/>Verify the sources</a><a href="#next-step"><Icon name="phone" size={18}/>Begin with Pinnacle</a></nav>
  <section class="pdk-section pdk-tint" id="what-it-does"><div class="pdk-wrap pdk-definition"><div><p class="pdk-kicker">The plain answer</p><h2>Keep the reason behind<br/><em>the next step.</em></h2><p>{c.direct}</p><p>A plan is more useful when it remembers <strong>what helped, where, with whom and why it was chosen.</strong> Your family’s knowledge belongs in that conversation.</p></div><aside class="pdk-quote"><Icon name="heart" size={34}/><blockquote>“It works at home. What could help at school?”</blockquote><p>That is a question to explore together. A record helps keep the conditions visible, so the next discussion can begin with the child’s experience.</p><a href={url('/verify/#how-pinnacleai-works')}>Read the documented workflow →</a></aside></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-section" id="worked-example"><div class="pdk-wrap"><div class="pdk-heading"><p class="pdk-kicker">A worked life moment · illustrative, not a patient result</p><h2>{c.example.title}</h2><p>{c.example.intro}</p></div><div class="pdk-record-pair">{c.example.observations.map(o=><article class="pdk-record"><h3><Icon name={o.icon} size={30}/>{o.setting}</h3><dl><dt>The setting and support</dt><dd>{o.context}</dd><dt>The observation</dt><dd>{o.observed}</dd><dt>What this tells the discussion</dt><dd>{o.meaning}</dd></dl></article>)}</div><div class="pdk-next-decision"><span class="pdk-decision-icon"><Icon name="compass" size={38}/></span><div><p class="pdk-kicker">A specific human decision</p><h3>Try familiar support in a different setting.</h3><p>{c.example.decision}</p></div></div><div class="pdk-checkpoint"><p class="pdk-kicker"><Icon name="clock" size={20}/>Next checkpoint · response pending</p><h3>Record what happens. Then decide.</h3><p>{c.example.checkpoint}</p></div><div class="pdk-review-branches">{c.example.reviews.map(r=><article><Icon name="loop" size={25}/><h3>{r.title}</h3><p>{r.text}</p></article>)}</div><p class="pdk-source-note">This invented example explains how context can inform a discussion. It does not prescribe a plan for a particular child. <a href={url('/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate')}>Explore Occupational Therapy’s activity and environment contribution →</a></p></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-section pdk-tint" id="architecture"><div class="pdk-wrap"><div class="pdk-heading"><p class="pdk-kicker">Inside PinnacleAI® · record architecture</p><h2>Useful information in.<br/><em>An explained next step out.</em></h2><p>PDK connects the care discussion over time. This is a readable model of the documented architecture, rather than a live child record or a claim that every source connects automatically.</p></div><ol class="pdk-architecture">{c.architecture.map((a,i)=><li><span class="pdk-step-number">0{i+1}</span><Icon name={a.icon} size={32}/><h3>{a.title}</h3><p>{a.text}</p></li>)}</ol><div class="pdk-feedback"><Icon name="loop" size={30}/><p><strong>The response comes back into review.</strong> Keep the proposed change and its actual observation distinguishable. That makes the next conversation more specific.</p></div><details class="pdk-access"><summary>What should my family ask about access and sharing?</summary><p>The dossier describes parental consent and authorised roles. Ask who records observations, who can view or contribute to them, how an inaccurate observation is corrected, and how any school input is agreed in your child’s actual arrangement. The source description is not an independent security audit.</p><a href={url('/verify/#how-pinnacleai-works')}>Dossier pages 48–49, 52–54 · source-linked explanation →</a></details></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-section" id="pinnacleai-journey"><div class="pdk-wrap"><div class="pdk-heading"><p class="pdk-kicker">A connected system. A purpose in your child’s life.</p><h2>The record supports the journey.<br/><em>The child gives it direction.</em></h2><p>From abilities and planning to everyday practice and review, context makes the next decision better informed. The purpose is growing independence and mainstream participation—with appropriate support.</p></div><ol class="pdk-stages">{c.stages.map((s,i)=><li><span>{i+1}</span><Icon name={s.icon} size={27}/><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><a href={url(s.href)}>Explore this part →</a></li>)}</ol><p class="pdk-source-note"><a href={url('/pinnacleai')}>Explore PinnacleAI®</a> · <a href={url('/prognose')}>Revisable planning</a> · <a href={url('/mainstream')}>Mainstream participation</a> · <a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>The life-first paradigm shift</a></p><h3 class="pdk-therapy-title">Different expertise. One child’s priorities.</h3><div class="pdk-therapies">{c.therapies.map(t=><a href={url(t.href)}><strong>{t.name} <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></strong><span>{t.text}</span></a>)}</div><p>Appropriate contributions depend on your child’s needs and professional review. Every child does not need every therapy.</p></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-section pdk-tint" id="sources"><div class="pdk-wrap"><div class="pdk-heading"><p class="pdk-kicker">Original records. Clear scope.</p><h2>Follow the evidence<br/><em>behind the explanation.</em></h2><p>Pinnacle Blooms Network is operated by Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited. These records explain the architecture, method and licensed software scope.</p></div><div class="pdk-sources">{c.sources.map(s=><article><p class="pdk-kicker">{s.label}</p><h3><Icon name={s.href.includes('md5')?'shield':'book'} size={25}/>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><a href={url(s.href)}>Inspect the source →</a></article>)}</div><p class="pdk-source-note">PDK is not separately claimed as an approved medical device. This public example contains no child data. <a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Open the citation library →</a></p><div class="pdk-actions pdk-source-downloads"><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/personal-development-kernel-sources.json">Source map · JSON</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/personal-development-kernel-sources.txt">Plain text</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/personal-development-kernel-reading.md">Markdown reading aid</a><a href={'https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent('How PinnacleAI connects a child’s context with the next care discussion: '+canonical)}>Share this explanation on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-section" id="questions"><div class="pdk-wrap pdk-faq-layout"><div><p class="pdk-kicker">Before you decide</p><h2>Your family’s questions<br/><em>belong here.</em></h2><p>Bring one everyday priority. You do not need to become a technology expert to have a useful conversation.</p></div><div class="pdk-faq">{c.faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="pdk-close" id="next-step"><div class="pdk-wrap"><p class="pdk-kicker">Every Child Counts®</p><h2>Tell us what matters<br/>in your child’s day.</h2><p>One routine. What helps. What feels different. Ask how a professional would use those observations to plan and review the next step.</p><ul><li><Icon name="heart"/>Tell us the priority you want help with.</li><li><Icon name="people"/>Ask about a suitable professional and centre.</li><li><Icon name="compass"/>Understand the first visit and fees before you choose.</li></ul><div class="pdk-actions"><a class="pdk-btn pdk-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-close-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="pdk-btn" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Plan a first conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="pdk-text-link" href={url('/centers')}>Find a centre →</a></div><p class="pdk-help">Telephone guidance is free. Suitable care and individual progress depend on your child’s needs and professional review.</p></div></section>
</div>
</PageLayout>
